      "name": "@ultraslow/dsh-price-watch",
      "title": {
        "en": "Price watch",
        "zh": "价格监控"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Watch flight and hotel prices: flights show a year of lowest daily fares or collect real flights with per-passenger tax-included fares; hotels take a city, hotel name and stay dates, then collect the lowest stay total and room types at your chosen rhythm. New prices push a Feishu card (identical results are skipped); hotel prices need a Ctrip sign-in.",
        "zh": "监控机票与酒店价格：机票按「行情」看未来一年每日最低价、按「监控」采集真实航班与乘客含税价；酒店输入城市、酒店名与住期，按节奏采集房型最低整段总价。价格有变化时推飞书卡片，相同内容不重复推送，酒店价格需登录携程。"
      },
